Fixed all four findings without deleting tests or weakening gates:

- `edge_size_limit_boundary_is_exact_per_workload` now pins maxima via `check_size_supported` and runs only size 1 end-to-end.
- Hung-child test uses a 10 s child sleep, drops the elapsed-time assertion and fixed margin, and checks only that no finish marker appears.
- Explicit-environment test now passes a non-empty sentinel and asserts the child wrote its markers.
- `edge_bench_md_path_is_the_working_directory` now drives the injected accessor instead of being disabled by `RB_BENCH_OUTPUT`.

All gates pass: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy -D warnings`, `cargo test --all-targets` (2728 passed), and `../rbops/verify.sh phase-073` (`VERIFY PASS`).
